['$schema', '$id', 'title', 'description', 'type', 'additionalProperties', 'required', 'properties', 'allOf', '$defs']
Data document embedded in html v1 output of the eight command-inventory:5 html commands. envelope is the complete command-envelope:5 value and the only parity source. Panels carry typed optional exploration data with explicit states, three separated limit layers and provenance that distinguishes in-document verified joins from host assertions. featureStates disclose required features without an admitted owner. The report codec, envelope5 host admission, subject-index recomputation, cross-record joins and deterministic byte budgets are admission rules of contract.md enforced by check.py. The raw SHA-256 of this exact document is its ReportAssetManifestV1.projectionSchemaSha256s member.
